                      (adybug/src/main.s):00143         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract irq_handler profile=framebuffer: Service Vbord by delegating the sole framebuffer publication point, then return from interrupt.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00144         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract joy_read_axis profile=input: Sample and normalize one joystick axis through the PIA comparator.
