                      (adybug/src/main.s):00173         ; Phase 4: joystick-driven Lady Bug movement over the authored screen.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00174         ;
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00175         ; Builds on Phase 2.3 (hi-res 320×192×16 + MMU + palette + IRQ tick) by:
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00176         ;   - Compiling tiled/coco-screen.tmx into a one-byte tile map and a
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00177         ;     deduplicated packed 4bpp tile atlas before assembly.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00178         ;   - Flattening visible Tiled layers and applying horizontal/vertical flips.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00179         ;   - blit_tile: 8 rows x 4 bytes, stride 160.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00180         ;   - Polling the right joystick through the PIA DAC/comparator path.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00181         ;   - Transparent 16x16 player frames with background save/restore.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00182         ;   - Semantic maze collision and dot removal.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00183         ;
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00184         ; Visible: the authored screen with a moving, maze-constrained Lady Bug.
